Homepage: https://github.com/anarkiwi/pocketchip-batt

Package: pocketchip-batt
Architecture: any
Depends: init-system-helpers, ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: PocketCHIP battery monitor service
 Publishes the AXP209 battery voltage (averaged, in mV) and charging state
 from the kernel power_supply class to /run/pocketchip-batt for pocket-home
 and the low battery warning and shutdown timers.
